WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.691
My mom stood in the doorway, frowning at me.

2
00:00:05.692 --> 00:00:09.621
"We're making healthy candy," I explained.

3
00:00:09.622 --> 00:00:15.060
"What you're making," said Mom, "is a big mess!"

4
00:00:15.061 --> 00:00:17.149
I looked around my room.

5
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.367
It was sort of a mess.

6
00:00:19.368 --> 00:00:23.296
Okay, it was a huge mess.

7
00:00:23.297 --> 00:00:26.313
"I want you to clean up," she said.

8
00:00:26.314 --> 00:00:29.386
"Right now, please!"

9
00:00:29.387 --> 00:00:34.019
After Mom left, I nibbled on a chocolate-covered lima bean.

10
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:37.038
It tasted awful.

11
00:00:37.039 --> 00:00:42.970
"Maybe my invention wasn't such a great idea after all," I said to Molly.

12
00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:47.869
Just then my friends Josh and Jenny knocked on my bedroom door.

13
00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:50.591
"Iggy, Molly," Josh said.

14
00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:52.685
"I have something to tell—Whoa!

15
00:00:52.686 --> 00:00:55.297
What a mess!"

16
00:00:55.298 --> 00:00:58.619
