17
00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.475
"But it didn't turn out so great."

18
00:01:01.476 --> 00:01:04.388
Tate heard us talking and looked in too.

19
00:01:04.389 --> 00:01:06.697
"Wow!" he said.

20
00:01:06.698 --> 00:01:10.311
"It looks like a tornado blew through here!"

21
00:01:10.312 --> 00:01:15.494
